      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEOLOGY (2) missed the placings for the third time in a row at the most recent outing when 65 metres away in tenth over 2240m at Melton. Recent form includes a win at this track four starts back on August 22. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Finds a suitable assignment and can make amends. JILLIBY BLISS (1) was in the money two runs ago then improved sharply at her latest appearance over 2230m at this track, scoring comfortably by 11 metres after being up on the pace from the outset. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Has the talent to make it two on end. LOW LIE THE FIELDS (6) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by a head at this track over 2230m. EMILY MEAGAN (3) is the best of the rest after finishing runner-up over 2230m at this track last time out.",
